  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ripping and tearing attacks come in a savage frenzy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Rending Fury<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you hit with all of the natural weapons normally required to rend your opponent, your rend deals double normal damage. In addition, whenever you rend if you confirm a critical hit with any of the natural weapons you use to rend, you can spend one use of your mythic power as a free action to double the damage dealt by your rend.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
